17. DEVIATIONS FROM PLAN
   None. No pretrained backbone, fine-tuning, attention pooling or self-supervised
   pretraining was introduced. Any future deviation must be recorded here.

18. NEXT EXPERIMENT HYPOTHESIS
   The cross-camera collapse outranks any tuning question: the pipeline does not
   transfer between capture devices. Candidate follow-ups, in priority order:
     E2  aggregation statistic (mean vs median vs IQR-augmented) and tile vs whole-image
     E3  feature-family ablation: which of texture / colour / frequency / geometry pays
     E4  camera-invariance: gray-world applied vs not, and per-camera gain
         normalisation of the texture bands, scored by the cross-camera test
     E5  regressor: robust (Huber) and gradient boosting on the identical matrix
   A new Model number is justified only by a change of kind, not of feature set.
